WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.039
It is not easy to pull a boat across the ocean.

2
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.773
After a few hours, the birds got tired.

3
00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:23.881
Up ahead was a small island.

4
00:00:23.882 --> 00:00:28.447
"We must rest for a while," they said to the doctor.

5
00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:32.110
So they pulled the boat to the island.

6
00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:34.679
The island was very beautiful.

7
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:39.441
There were many high mountains and colorful flowers.

8
00:00:39.442 --> 00:00:42.047
"What a lovely place!"

9
00:00:42.048 --> 00:00:45.105
Dr. Dolittle said as he admired the view.

10
00:00:45.106 --> 00:00:50.332
"WOOF! ARF! ARF!" Jip started to bark loudly.

11
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:54.047
Dr. Dolittle turned around to see why.

12
00:00:54.048 --> 00:00:57.048
A lot of rats were coming off the boat.

13
00:00:57.049 --> 00:00:59.130
Jip was running around them.

14
00:00:59.131 --> 00:01:03.538
"Chasing rats is my favorite game," he barked.

15
00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:06.864
"Stop it, Jip!" the doctor called out.

16
00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:10.578
The rats were afraid of the big dog.

17
00:01:10.579 --> 00:01:15.605
One big black rat carefully crawled over to the doctor.

18
00:01:15.606 --> 00:01:19.190
He was scared that Jip might chase him.

19
00:01:19.191 --> 00:01:24.255
"Excuse me, Doctor," the rat said in a soft voice.

20
00:01:24.256 --> 00:01:30.357
"Dr. Dolittle! Someone wants to speak with you," a bird called out.

21
00:01:30.358 --> 00:01:36.701
"Oh, hello. What's going on?" the kind doctor asked.

22
00:01:36.702 --> 00:01:40.175
The rat wiped his mouth and whiskers.

23
00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:43.881
"All ships have rats," he said.

24
00:01:43.882 --> 00:01:50.068
"And rats never stay on sinking ships," the rat kept one eye on Jip.

25
00:01:50.069 --> 00:01:56.412
"Yes. JIP! Stop chasing those rats!" Dr. Dolittle shouted.

26
00:01:56.413 --> 00:02:01.468
"And rats are always right," the rat wiped his mouth again.

27
00:02:01.469 --> 00:02:02.925
"Oh, do hurry up!

28
00:02:02.926 --> 00:02:08.391
What is it you want to say?" Dab-Dab snapped.

29
00:02:08.392 --> 00:02:11.888
"Your boat is sinking," the rat spoke quickly.

30
00:02:11.889 --> 00:02:15.082
"How do you know?" asked the doctor.

31
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.819
"Rats have a special sense,"

32
00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:19.533
the rat said, waving his tail.

33
00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:20.794
"Don't get on your boat!

34
00:02:20.795 --> 00:02:24.660
IT WILL SINK!"

35
00:02:24.661 --> 00:02:27.884
Dr. Dolittle went to look for water.

36
00:02:27.885 --> 00:02:31.256
"Do you believe that rat?" asked Dab-Dab.

37
00:02:31.257 --> 00:02:36.326
"Yes. Why would he lie?" the doctor replied.

38
00:02:36.327 --> 00:02:41.402
"Because all rats lie," the duck said with a frown.

39
00:02:41.403 --> 00:02:43.899
But Dr. Dolittle believed the rat.

40
00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:47.226
He and the animals would have to stay on the island now.

41
00:02:47.227 --> 00:02:50.005
So he went to look for food and water.

42
00:02:50.006 --> 00:02:52.328
"Just look, Dab-Dab!"

43
00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:57.272
Dr. Dolittle pointed to a beautiful lake.

44
00:02:57.273 --> 00:03:02.074
Dr. Dolittle and the animals had plenty to drink and eat.

45
00:03:02.075 --> 00:03:06.748
"Look! Bananas!" Gub-Gub shoved one in his mouth.

46
00:03:06.749 --> 00:03:11.972
"I love green grass," the pushmi-pullyu said happily.

47
00:03:11.973 --> 00:03:17.155
"I noticed," the duck said, "that only one of you eats."

48
00:03:17.156 --> 00:03:22.793
"Yes, one eats while the other talks," smiled the pushmi-pullyu.

49
00:03:22.794 --> 00:03:26.412
A little later, they all lay down to rest.

50
00:03:26.413 --> 00:03:30.445
"What are we going to do about the boat?" Jip asked.

51
00:03:30.446 --> 00:03:34.272
"I don't know," Dr. Dolittle replied.

52
00:03:34.273 --> 00:03:40.504
"If the rats are right, then we won't be able to continue," the dog worried.

53
00:03:40.505 --> 00:03:44.422
At that moment, two birds flew toward them.

54
00:03:44.423 --> 00:03:48.895
"Dr. Dolittle! Dr. Dolittle!" cried one.

55
00:03:48.896 --> 00:03:51.803
"What is it?" the doctor asked.

56
00:03:51.804 --> 00:03:57.450
"Pirates! On the island!" gasped the other bird.

57
00:03:57.451 --> 00:04:00.731
The Barbary pirates were on the island.

58
00:04:00.732 --> 00:04:02.507
"Don't worry! Come with us!

59
00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.324
We'll help you escape," said one bird.

60
00:04:05.325 --> 00:04:09.177
"But how?" asked Dr. Dolittle.

61
00:04:09.178 --> 00:04:10.762
"You must take the pirates' ship.

62
00:04:10.763 --> 00:04:16.340
It's very big and fast!"

63
00:04:16.341 --> 00:04:19.066
There was no one on the ship.

64
00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:22.279
"Hurry! Hurry!" whispered the birds.

65
00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.406
Dr. Dolittle quickly got on the ship.

66
00:04:25.407 --> 00:04:27.659
The animals followed quietly.

67
00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:34.161
But then Gub-Gub dropped some of his bananas into the water. SPLASH!

68
00:04:34.162 --> 00:04:37.125
"Stop! Stop right there!"

69
00:04:37.126 --> 00:04:44.106
yelled the Barbary pirates as they ran out from the trees.
